@startuml
title SD-F08A — Merchant recovery controls
caption FN-ADM-01–02 · To-Be · Frontend and Identity
actor Merchant
boundary "Recovery form" as UI
control Identity
database PostgreSQL as DB
participant "Verified provider" as Provider
participant "Controlled operator path" as Support
Merchant -> UI : Recover access
alt Enrolled channel available
 UI -> Identity : Request RECOVERY challenge
 Identity -> Provider : Send to enrolled verified contact
 UI -> Identity : Submit code
 Identity -> DB : Lock admin then challenge; verify current credential epoch
 alt Accepted
  DB -> DB : Advance epoch, revoke prior sessions and issue new session
  Identity --> UI : Return to merchant workspace
 else Unknown or failed
  Identity --> UI : Generic recovery feedback, no access
 end
else All channels lost
 Merchant -> Support : Request restricted owner verification
 Support -> DB : Lock admin, advance epoch, revoke sessions and audit
 Merchant -> UI : Verify newly enrolled contact through same challenge
end
@enduml
